    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a904520347bbc3324c0ce6a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明同学或许能够成为史上第三位\n三冠赛马娘……甚至还有可能超越\n那位被称为“神话”的赛马娘……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ed412b410b820a75cd97fbf505ee8c12231a8efc9c74fa0d77b1f95a81b6ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
