    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1e2d23d9633f3871d3a77d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“神话”啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0879e4604cad744bca0126ab3e3bbb27359faebd0e50111a36ff0adcaa620a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be4540c7eb3f40927015c41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──过去，\n曾有一名被誉为“神话”的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7945ceb99f1f4c7fc016c02063a450b78cc6101c8d5f732bbe6dd8c314c70c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3479afa022725e569f09eb53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2ed51a4f1bab94d7cfad72158d24dc1b65b6e98236640c4943c73987c0fb8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faec56f57a91743a5da71218",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜率这种东西一点都不自由。\n我不想在赛场上被束缚──",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b9188775526eb71a8f9f3e7a5222df379c7a66bcafb9b5ed89afc29246963d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ed3dc529a543f8d221c1d17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那位赛马娘的战绩是19战15胜，\n拥有压倒性的实力。但她最为人传颂的……\n还是达成经典三冠的壮举。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7148f42796979b314dcfc858d10030cdaf57ff80b6c5db8d08e5e70ac5560d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5468e467d6b19357bd698bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在闪耀系列赛的历史上，\n只有两人曾经获得这项荣誉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b09c9bf46ad1ba82efc1201dd14502b8f363aa59a6e4386afe5af268c50d924",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f34411bb43372ea970f1714",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在她之后就没有人能达成这项壮举──\n现在甚至开始有传言说\n再也没人能够办到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3206016fc14bf5b84163f70f1ca41ee5e0400a6e0c2b4ed9bb04a8695f403e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c70db68908febccfb2d149",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赢得经典三冠就是如此困难的目标，\n她留下的成绩与带给世人的震撼，\n确实足以被称为“神话”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf1918f0eb88d6d25b75c637710815e751076800ff18792ad9930265d7b11db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d7baa90282dd881a3b6a7de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对赛马娘来说，\n被期待能够超越那个“神话”，\n可以说是最高等级的评价──",
      "source_fingerprint": "029878946d19943025752385cd455d6040d567bee59283a765eb2f8728796c80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
