    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:738cef139465862f0af6828c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我当然明白她有多厉害。\n如果有人以她为目标，我会替那个人加油，\n我也不会瞧不起大家的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d39529c08a478c23f7f2fcba9e1018beda049fc4d295f23d069fc7b1730debc",
